full Python regex syntax, so you can use capture groups and backreferences in the `replacement=`
string.

::: {#7664177d .cell execution_count=5}
``` {.python .cell-code}
(
    gt_tbl
    .text_replace(
        pattern=r"(\w+)_(\w+)",
        replacement=r"\1 \2",
        locations=loc.body(columns="status")
    )
)
```

